    "text": "If <math><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cot</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo></mrow></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi></mrow></mrow></math> then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">w</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Z</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>"
